    - text: 」です。\n    - paragraph [ref=s3e600]:\n      - text: 強化学習の枠組みで累積報酬\n      - math [ref=s3e604]:\n        - generic [ref=s3e608]: G\n        - generic [ref=s3e609]: t\n      - text: が計算されるため、その期待値である状態価値\n      - math [ref=s3e613]:\n        - generic [ref=s3e617]: V\n        - generic [ref=s3e618]: t\n      - text: も学習が可能です。\n      - text: 一方で、方策モデルを学習する際に、Advantage\n      - math [ref=s3e623]:\n        - generic [ref=s3e627]: A\n        - generic [ref=s3e628]: t\n      - text: というものを利用します。\n    - paragraph [ref=s3e629]:\n      - text: Advantage\n      - math [ref=s3e633]:\n        - generic [ref=s3e637]: A\n        - generic [ref=s3e638]: t\n      - text: というのは下記の式で表されます。\n    - math [ref=s3e645]:\n      - generic [ref=s3e649]: A\n      - generic [ref=s3e650]: t\n      - generic [ref=s3e651]: =\n      - generic [ref=s3e653]: G\n      - generic [ref=s3e654]: t\n      - generic [ref=s3e655]: −\n      - generic [ref=s3e657]: V\n      - generic [ref=s3e658]: t\n      - generic [ref=s3e659]: (\n      - generic [ref=s3e661]: v\n      - generic [ref=s3e662]: t\n      - generic [ref=s3e663]: ∣\n      - generic [ref=s3e665]: "y"\n      - generic [ref=s3e667]: <\n      - generic [ref=s3e668]: t\n      - generic [ref=s3e669]: ","\n      - generic [ref=s3e670]: x\n      - generic [ref=s3e671]: )\n    - paragraph [ref=s3e672]:\n      - text: 状態価値\n      - math [ref=s3e676]:\n        - generic [ref=s3e680]: V\n        - generic [ref=s3e681]: t\n        - generic [ref=s3e682]: (\n        - generic [ref=s3e684]: v\n        - generic [ref=s3e685]: t\n        - generic [ref=s3e686]: ∣\n        - generic [ref=s3e688]: "y"\n        - generic [ref=s3e690]: <\n        - generic [ref=s3e691]: t\n        - generic [ref=s3e692]: ","\n        - generic [ref=s3e693]: x\n        - generic [ref=s3e694]: )\n      - text: は、累積報酬\n      - math [ref=s3e698]:\n        - generic [ref=s3e702]: G\n        - generic [ref=s3e703]: t\n      - text: の期待値（大雑把にいうと平均）になるように学習されているという前提があるため、Advantage\